<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77637" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντοθεν</span></b> , Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶς</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>from all
				quarters, from every side</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.623
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1240
			</span></i> (lyr.), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. πληθύνομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1370
				</span></i>
			: in 
				Ion.
			 Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.138
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.129
			</span></i>: rare in 
				Att.
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πανταχόθεν</span> being
			preferred), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Criti.</u>
				117e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ π. κέρδαινε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					625
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mon.</u>
				63
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ μόνον κατ᾽ εὐθυωρίαν, ἀλλὰ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>PA</u>
					656b29
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. λαμβάνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>EN</u>
					1121b32
				</span></i>
			: freq. with Prep., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐκ κευθμῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.28
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ γὰρ κακὰ π. ἔστη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					14.270
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. εἰδώλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arat.
					455
				</span></i>
			:—the form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντοθε</span></b>  is only v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.225
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				17.97
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.85
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Lucill.
			</span></i>).—On the accent, v.
			<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				192.2
			</span></i>.</div>
